+/* Time spent inside each kernel call, by thread, ordinal, first argument
+ * and guest call site; the top entries every 10 s (RECOMP_KSTATS=1: every
+ * 2 s, RECOMP_KSTATS=0: off). Shows what
+ * a thread that makes no progress is actually waiting on, and for how long
