+/* Engine profile (RECOMP_ENGINE_PROF=0 turns it off): about 1000 times a
+ * second the ack thread is stopped for a moment and its instruction pointer
+ * noted. Every 10 s the hottest places are logged: offsets into this exe
+ * (nm resolves them), other modules by name, and for time spent inside
